  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ActorDefinition SpenserUnit</b></p><a name=\"SpenserUnit\"> </a><a name=\"hcSpenserUnit\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Actor: SpenserUnit </b></td><td>Spenser Unit</td><td>Type: system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>A single dispenser. As a <strong>server</strong> it accepts an order posted straight at it and dispenses on the spot, because posting to the device is itself the authorization to dispense. As a <strong>client</strong> it polls an Order Server, acts only on orders that have been made actionable, and reports back what it did.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"interfaces.html\">Interfaces</a>.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"pt\" lang=\"pt\"><hr/><p><b>Portuguese</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: ActorDefinition SpenserUnit</b></p><a name=\"pt-SpenserUnit\"> </a><a name=\"pt-hcSpenserUnit\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Actor: SpenserUnit </b></td><td>Unidade Spenser</td><td>Tipo: system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>A single dispenser. As a <strong>server</strong> it accepts an order posted straight at it and dispenses on the spot, because posting to the device is itself the authorization to dispense. As a <strong>client</strong> it polls an Order Server, acts only on orders that have been made actionable, and reports back what it did.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"interfaces.html\">Interfaces</a>.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"nl\" lang=\"nl\"><hr/><p><b>Dutch</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Gegenereerde narrative: ActorDefinition SpenserUnit</b></p><a name=\"nl-SpenserUnit\"> </a><a name=\"nl-hcSpenserUnit\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Actor: SpenserUnit </b></td><td>Spenser-unit</td><td>Type: system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>A single dispenser. As a <strong>server</strong> it accepts an order posted straight at it and dispenses on the spot, because posting to the device is itself the authorization to dispense. As a <strong>client</strong> it polls an Order Server, acts only on orders that have been made actionable, and reports back what it did.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"interfaces.html\">Interfaces</a>.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : ActorDefinition SpenserUnit</b></p><a name=\"fr-SpenserUnit\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSpenserUnit\"> </a><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Acteur : SpenserUnit </b></td><td>Unité Spenser</td><td>Type : system </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><div><p>A single dispenser. As a <strong>server</strong> it accepts an order posted straight at it and dispenses on the spot, because posting to the device is itself the authorization to dispense. As a <strong>client</strong> it polls an Order Server, acts only on orders that have been made actionable, and reports back what it did.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"interfaces.html\">Interfaces</a>.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
