  fhir:documentation [ fhir:v "A single dispenser. As a **server** it accepts an order posted straight at it and dispenses on the spot, because posting to the device is itself the authorization to dispense. As a **client** it polls an Order Server, acts only on orders that have been made actionable, and reports back what it did.\n\nSee [Interfaces](interfaces.html)."] . # 

